[en.DECISION_C01_C04_WAR]
Prepare for Suppressing Stratusburg

[en.DECISION_C01_C04_WAR_desc]
Stratusburg has been independent from the Empire, we need to suppress their resistance and show the power of the Empire.

[zh.DECISION_C01_C04_WAR]
